37
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:34,530
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">The Dark Cloud</font></font>

38
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:34,530
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Sneaks Up</font></font>

39
00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come... come... come...</font>

40
00:01:45,910 --> 00:01:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The villagers are welcoming us.</font>

41
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone seems to be safe.</font>

42
00:01:51,290 --> 00:01:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like the Kurosuki Family
ran away in fear.</font>

43
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:10,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

44
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they come!</font>

45
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Don't come...</font>

46
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you value your life
be quiet.</font>

47
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:19,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi...</font>

48
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that you were deeply sorry
for your actions...!</font>

49
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could I shamelessly
run back to the curry house?!</font>

50
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

51
00:02:58,610 --> 00:02:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you see that?!</font>

52
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although Master Raiga is not around
the Kurosuki Family is eternal!</font>

53
00:03:06,290 --> 00:03:08,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... what are you looking for?</font>

54
00:03:09,250 --> 00:03:12,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it obvious? The brats!</font>

55
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:14,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you referring to us?</font>

56
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

57
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What you crushed were our forms</font>

58
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:27,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">made by the Shadow Clone Jutsu
and the Transformation Jutsu.</font>

59
00:03:27,930 --> 00:03:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take formation!</font>

60
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:34,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Black Tornado!</font>

61
00:03:40,950 --> 00:03:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

62
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those were also made by</font>

63
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Shadow Clone Jutsu
and the Transformation Jutsu!</font>

64
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We saw through everything!</font>

65
00:04:36,210 --> 00:04:37,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go.</font>

66
00:04:59,110 --> 00:05:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

67
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Disperse!</font>

68
00:05:17,500 --> 00:05:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

69
00:05:28,510 --> 00:05:30,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">2 palms! 4 palms!</font>

70
00:05:30,350 --> 00:05:32,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 palms!
16 palms!</font>

71
00:05:35,810 --> 00:05:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">32 palms!</font>

72
00:05:38,350 --> 00:05:40,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams 64 Palms!</font>

73
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:46,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come!
Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

74
00:05:52,950 --> 00:05:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Spinning Axe Kick!</font>

75
00:05:58,710 --> 00:06:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Oww...</font>

76
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:03,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already over...</font>

77
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Not fair!</font>

78
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man! You could've saved
some for me!</font>

79
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:12,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just when I thought
I'd try the new Jutsu!</font>

80
00:06:16,810 --> 00:06:20,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosh, you never learn do you!</font>

81
00:06:21,110 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi, are you prepared?</font>

82
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just kidding!</font>

83
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:28,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you torment us!</font>

84
00:06:28,490 --> 00:06:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really think
we'll let this slide as a joke?</font>

85
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:34,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't help it! If I didn't listen</font>

86
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would have gotten killed
by the Kurosuki family.</font>

87
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In place of the Kurosuki family</font>

88
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll crack your head
with this hammer!</font>

89
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:42,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Yeah!</font>

90
00:06:44,170 --> 00:06:45,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

91
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please move, Lee!</font>

92
00:06:48,130 --> 00:06:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please hit me until
you guys are satisfied.</font>

93
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you?</font>

94
00:06:53,350 --> 00:06:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's partly my responsibility</font>

95
00:06:56,770 --> 00:07:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the once kind-hearted Karashi
went and joined a gang.</font>

96
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yours?</font>

97
00:07:03,690 --> 00:07:04,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of me</font>

98
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he got the impression
that power is everything.</font>

99
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:09,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, that's right!</font>

100
00:07:09,570 --> 00:07:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though I knew that it's a bad thing
I just had to...</font>

101
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:13,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You be quiet!</font>

102
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:16,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi is still inexperienced.</font>

103
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:21,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he has skills to make curry
that can save people's lives.</font>

104
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please give Karashi the opportunity
to make amends by making curry.</font>

105
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:31,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Karashi goes astray again
then I will...!</font>

106
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Punish him with my fists!</font>

107
00:07:38,930 --> 00:07:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone what do you think</font>

108
00:07:41,730 --> 00:07:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about letting Lee and Grandma Sansho
take care of this situation...</font>

109
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all he was just
an underling of the Kurosuki family.</font>

110
00:07:50,570 --> 00:07:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like he directly
attacked us or anything...</font>

111
00:07:54,370 --> 00:07:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's have Lee educate him harshly...</font>

112
00:07:59,910 --> 00:08:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...</font>

113
00:08:06,380 --> 00:08:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much!</font>

114
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-Thank you...</font>

115
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And with this our mission is complete.</font>

116
00:08:13,130 --> 00:08:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No not yet...</font>

117
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

118
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right?</font>

119
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:39,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the point of being all right?</font>

120
00:08:40,330 --> 00:08:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't live alone.</font>

121
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that!</font>

122
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we just
leave this weakling!</font>

123
00:08:47,210 --> 00:08:49,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone has to live alone!</font>

124
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But don't you need friends
who can help you and stuff...?</font>

125
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm talking about some basics!
I hate people who are indecisive!</font>

126
00:08:59,010 --> 00:09:01,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was frail
from the time I was born.</font>

127
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:06,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That shabby cabin was
the entire world for me.</font>

128
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no memory of my parents...</font>

129
00:09:13,570 --> 00:09:15,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I survived only by
the small amount of food</font>

130
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:19,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the villagers sometimes
brought me...</font>

131
00:09:23,250 --> 00:09:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even someone like me
had a power that no one else did.</font>

132
00:09:52,190 --> 00:09:53,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go.</font>

133
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:55,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

134
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is your leg okay?
The one you cut with the scythe?</font>

135
00:10:00,030 --> 00:10:02,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Did I tell you that story?!</font>

136
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I kind of found out...</font>

137
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How? No one else besides me
came today or yesterday, right?</font>

138
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:14,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I just saw it from here...</font>

139
00:10:16,380 --> 00:10:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scary!</font>

140
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As time went by everyone began
to fear me since I had the power</font>

141
00:10:22,010 --> 00:10:25,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to know what was happening outside
even from my room.</font>

142
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you know?!</font>

143
00:10:29,770 --> 00:10:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that Ranmaru has
the ability to see everything...</font>

144
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were we being spied on every day?</font>

145
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of the village!</font>

146
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You monster!</font>

147
00:10:42,450 --> 00:10:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so I had no more visitors...</font>

148
00:10:46,410 --> 00:10:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I could do was to wait to die.</font>

149
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:52,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's when Raiga saved me...</font>

150
00:10:59,090 --> 00:11:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. What a bitter past.</font>

151
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, it is.</font>

152
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...</font>

153
00:11:05,510 --> 00:11:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga took me out to
the unknown world.</font>

154
00:11:15,770 --> 00:11:18,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru, try opening your eyes...</font>

155
00:11:21,570 --> 00:11:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the outside world where
we'll be living from now on... okay?</font>

156
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

157
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:36,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Raiga isn't here
it's the same as losing my body.</font>

158
00:11:37,710 --> 00:11:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps Raiga became known</font>

159
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:42,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as one of the Seven Ninja Swords
Men of the Mist</font>

160
00:11:43,010 --> 00:11:46,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because he was able
to borrow your power.</font>

161
00:11:46,810 --> 00:11:49,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like you two
helped each other to live...</font>

162
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

163
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true!</font>

164
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were being used for
Raiga's evil deeds!</font>

165
00:11:57,360 --> 00:12:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might have been... used...</font>

166
00:12:01,570 --> 00:12:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But good or bad doesn't matter to me.
I'm just a sense organ...</font>

167
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that won't mean
that you're really living!</font>

168
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:13,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

169
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:17,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you have to do your best
to live from now on!</font>

170
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:22,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Firstly, eat the curry of life
and cheer up!</font>

171
00:12:22,590 --> 00:12:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!
You will get nourishment.</font>

172
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That will hurt the body instead,
wouldn't it?</font>

173
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you can't eat it either, right?</font>

174
00:12:32,430 --> 00:12:35,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually the more I eat it</font>

175
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:38,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the more energized my body feels...</font>

176
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That curry saved my life you know!</font>

177
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until the day you're able
to walk alone</font>

178
00:12:48,030 --> 00:12:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will become your body!</font>

179
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay?</font>

180
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have one favor to ask...</font>

181
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

182
00:13:13,450 --> 00:13:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

183
00:13:26,780 --> 00:13:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I expected...
I can no longer see life in Raiga.</font>

184
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:30,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you see Ranmaru?</font>

185
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

186
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this okay?</font>

187
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

188
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go... Mission is complete.</font>

189
00:13:55,500 --> 00:13:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

190
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— That is...!</font>

191
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two, one, two.</font>

192
00:14:08,510 --> 00:14:09,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho!</font>

193
00:14:10,170 --> 00:14:14,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's all this ruckus?!
Dust will go into the curry.</font>

194
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Lee and the others came back!</font>

195
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:20,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">K-Karashi is with them!</font>

196
00:14:21,310 --> 00:14:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it worth the ruckus?</font>

197
00:14:24,310 --> 00:14:27,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma, aren't you happy?</font>

198
00:14:27,690 --> 00:14:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two... One, two...</font>

199
00:14:31,530 --> 00:14:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your snot will go in!</font>

200
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho! I'm back!</font>

201
00:14:41,370 --> 00:14:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi is here too!</font>

202
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Mom, sorry!
Please forgive me!</font>

203
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive him...</font>

204
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:58,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He says he'll devote himself
from now on</font>

205
00:14:58,750 --> 00:15:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and train to take over
the Curry of Life Shop so please...</font>

206
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First you gotta eat...</font>

207
00:15:10,890 --> 00:15:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...</font>

208
00:15:13,690 --> 00:15:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, it looks good!</font>

209
00:15:15,690 --> 00:15:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're not going to eat I will!</font>

210
00:15:18,730 --> 00:15:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've prepared some for each of you...</font>

211
00:15:22,410 --> 00:15:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, that's a very pale child.</font>

212
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, can you prepare
some for him too?</font>

213
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially mild...</font>

214
00:15:31,830 --> 00:15:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I prefer mild too...</font>

215
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my...</font>

216
00:15:42,260 --> 00:15:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom... thanks for the food!</font>

217
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a punishment times 300 curry...</font>

218
00:15:54,810 --> 00:15:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's spicy, it's spicy...</font>

219
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:59,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's good! It's good, Mom!</font>

220
00:16:04,990 --> 00:16:07,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I have some for everybody!</font>

221
00:16:14,830 --> 00:16:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay, it's mild.</font>

222
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:24,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way you were part of</font>

223
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Seven Ninja Swordsmen of
the Mist with Raiga, right?</font>

224
00:16:27,550 --> 00:16:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know a guy
named Zabuza?</font>

225
00:16:30,390 --> 00:16:31,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza... you say?</font>

226
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, then...</font>

227
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about a guy with this huge sword
wrapped with something like a bandage</font>

228
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and has fish eyes?</font>

229
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... that's Kisame...</font>

230
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, Kisame!</font>

231
00:16:43,650 --> 00:16:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So do you know what
he's up to right now?</font>

232
00:16:47,110 --> 00:16:50,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I heard that he slipped out
from the Mist Village.</font>

233
00:16:51,370 --> 00:16:54,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know his face but I don't know
anything beyond that.</font>

234
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

235
00:16:58,710 --> 00:17:02,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should I ask Grandma to
make you something else?</font>

236
00:17:02,710 --> 00:17:07,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I don't need it...
I don't want to eat anything.</font>

237
00:17:13,890 --> 00:17:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for your help...</font>

238
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much.</font>

239
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make a good village with everyone!</font>

240
00:17:24,990 --> 00:17:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... where is Lee?</font>

241
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His mission still isn't complete.</font>

242
00:17:37,290 --> 00:17:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please wait Lee... I'm gonna die!</font>

243
00:17:42,250 --> 00:17:44,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's take a break here!</font>

244
00:17:46,050 --> 00:17:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do 300 push ups.</font>

245
00:17:48,900 --> 00:17:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

246
00:17:50,050 --> 00:17:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two... One, two...</font>

247
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">300... all right.</font>

248
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:06,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like...
there's going to be a storm.</font>

249
00:18:10,820 --> 00:18:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if a real storm comes</font>

250
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:16,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it should be fine if we reinforce it
with these big trees!</font>

251
00:18:17,330 --> 00:18:19,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, thanks for doing this.</font>

252
00:18:20,330 --> 00:18:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's our thanks for the curry.</font>

253
00:18:22,250 --> 00:18:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-uh.</font>

254
00:18:23,710 --> 00:18:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But compared to you guys
my Karashi is...</font>

255
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten? I'm worried about
Karashi and Ranmaru</font>

256
00:18:32,050 --> 00:18:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whom we left behind
at the curry shop.</font>

257
00:18:34,180 --> 00:18:37,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're okay
so could you check on them there?</font>

258
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:42,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi?!</font>

259
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

260
00:18:52,110 --> 00:18:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is the Boss really still alive?</font>

261
00:18:53,950 --> 00:18:57,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Neji person didn't seem
to sense it then...</font>

262
00:18:58,450 --> 00:18:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I know.</font>

263
00:19:25,230 --> 00:19:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga...</font>

264
00:19:27,570 --> 00:19:28,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

265
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were everything to me!</font>

266
00:19:35,820 --> 00:19:38,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was only waiting to die...</font>

267
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you told me that
we'll live on together!</font>

268
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:59,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me, being with you was living...</font>

269
00:20:00,930 --> 00:20:04,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't hold a funeral for you either.</font>

270
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it costs me my life
I won't let you die!</font>

271
00:20:21,950 --> 00:20:22,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru!</font>

272
00:20:27,210 --> 00:20:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you die, Ranmaru?!</font>

273
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi...?</font>

274
00:21:16,970 --> 00:21:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

275
00:21:16,970 --> 00:21:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

276
00:21:28,650 --> 00:21:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

277
00:21:28,650 --> 00:21:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

278
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

279
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

280
00:21:51,040 --> 00:22:03,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

281
00:21:51,040 --> 00:22:03,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

282
00:22:03,380 --> 00:22:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

283
00:22:03,380 --> 00:22:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

284
00:22:14,900 --> 00:22:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

285
00:22:14,900 --> 00:22:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

286
00:22:26,500 --> 00:22:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

287
00:22:26,500 --> 00:22:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

288
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:40,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What?! Tenten fell off the cliff?!</font>

289
00:22:40,580 --> 00:22:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Then we gotta go save her
right away!</font>

290
00:22:42,210 --> 00:22:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Please calm down! Naruto!</font>

291
